 should be obtained from recognized institutions and should complement, rather than substitute for, required dental education and registration."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After BDS and applicable registration/entrance requirements, the dentist can pursue postgraduate specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"Major Dental Specialties"},{"type":"h","text":"Conservative Dentistry & Endodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Orthodontics & Dentofacial Orthopedics"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontology"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral & Maxillofacial Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Medicine & Radiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pediatric & Preventive Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Other Pathways"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Administration"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospital Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Informatics"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental Education"}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. General Dental Surgeon"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive care"},{"type":"h","text":"Restorative dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Extractions"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic prosthetic care"},{"type":"h","text":"Routine oral-health management"},{"type":"h","text":"2. Cosmetic / Esthetic Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"h","text":"Smile aesthetics"},{"type":"h","text":"Whitening"},{"type":"h","text":"Veneers"},{"type":"h","text":"Cosmetic restorations"},{"type":"p","text":"Complex cases may require additional training."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Implant Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"h","text":"Implant planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Implant placement"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthetic restoration"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced implant procedures should be