e":"h","text":"Caries detection"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment planning"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Printing"},{"type":"h","text":"Applications include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Models"},{"type":"h","text":"Surgical guides"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental appliances"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthetic workflows"},{"type":"h","text":"Teledentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Can support:"},{"type":"h","text":"Preliminary consultations"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-up"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient education"},{"type":"h","text":"Remote triage"},{"type":"p","text":"Subject to applicable professional and regulatory requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Robotics"},{"type":"p","text":"Robotic and computer-assisted technologies are developing in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Implant planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontics"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By completion of BDS and required clinical training, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Strong dental-science foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical examination skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral-disease recognition"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment-planning ability"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic restorative skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic oral-surgical competence within training"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal assessment skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontic fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Pediatric-dentistry exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency recognition"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection-control competence"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-based dentistry skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital-dentistry awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional ethics"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Professional Portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"BDS Academic Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Rotations"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Compulsory Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Anonymized Case Portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Audit / Research Project"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Community Oral-Health Project"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"BLS / Emergency Training"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Dentistry Exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Registration"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"DENTAL SCIENCES"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"ORAL DIAGNOSIS"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"RESTORATIVE DENTISTRY"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"ORAL SURGERY"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"PERIODONTOLOGY"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"ENDODONTIC FOUNDATION"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"PROSTHODONTICS"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"PEDIATRIC DENTISTRY"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"INFECTION CONTROL"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"PATIENT COMMUNICATION"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"DENTAL EMERGENCY CARE"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"EVIDENCE-BASED DENTISTRY"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"DIGITAL DENTISTRY"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI DENTAL LITERACY"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"CLINIC MANAGEMENT"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this career is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Clinically competent general dental surgeon specializing in comprehensive oral assessment, preventive care, restorative treatment, minor oral surgery, patient communication and modern digital dentistry.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The professional development pathway should connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Oral Health Assessment","Diagnosis","Treatment Planning","Dental Procedure","Patient Education","Follow-up","Prevention"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career-Fitment Mapping Note"},{"type":"p","text":"Dental Surgeon (Clinic) is a regulated healthcare profession. The BDS pathway should therefore be represented as BDS + required clinical internship + applicable professional registration, rather than treating the academic degree alone as sufficient for independent practice. Advanced specialist procedures and specialist titles generally require additional recognized postgraduate training and appropriate clinical competence. Exact registration and scope-of-practice requirements should be verified against the current rules of the applicable dental regulator."}]}]}